          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "You taking L's, baby, hold my hand and feel the wind, uh",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Now fasten your seat belt, and turn everything off",
